{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>朝鮮指，日前試射採用人工智能技術的新型魚雷武器系統。</p><p></p><p>朝中社報道，朝鮮周四進行新型超高速精確制導魚雷武器系統「潛-2.0」實彈發射試驗，以驗證新型魚雷武器系統的技術更新升級成果。報道指，新型魚雷的目標搜索及制導功能採用了人工智能技術。過去五年曾進行180多次試驗，不斷提升推進系統性能及效率。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.MISSILE-1100.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026ShBqxYrqCD1792207660.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>朝鮮近期頻繁試射武器，過去一周分別曾試射多枚潛射戰略巡航導彈及彈道導彈。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.NK.MISSILE-1100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20267QJp8lxks71792208508.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T04:39:22.147696+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":183,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T02:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T09:10:38.147667+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T04:37:41.267717+00:00","content_hash":"4bc560aa741a8f68658eadb1d1964f35656c549f204908974c720473334eee8e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}